              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "href": null,
              "text": "Already know how to ski and interested in shredding with us? Husky Winter Sports is open for any current UW student to join, we accept both undergrad and grad students! Come check us out and learn more at these upcoming events:"
            }
